      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "° Open source framework\n  for evaluating and \n  benchmarking LLMs\n\n° Lets you evaluate different\n  models through a unified interface\n\n    ==> it eliminated the need to \n        write separate code for \n        each model",
